  "description": "High-performance .NET HTTP client. Fast surface (FastClient + FastH2Client + FastH3Client) — span-based codec, arena buffers, per-core sharded H/1.1 pool, multiplexed H/2 connections, QUIC-multiplexed H/3 with QPACK dynamic table — beats System.Net.Http.HttpClient on latency and allocation across HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2 (h2c and h2 over TLS+ALPN), and HTTP/3 single-stream. Legacy surface (CosmoClient, CosmoPipelineClient, CosmoWebSocket) covers cookies, redirects, retries, response cache, decompression, NDJSON, WebSockets, and pipelining. gRPC framing primitives included.",
